00:10:08.107 --> 00:10:11.077
Like you have to be attracted
to me if this and all of those

00:10:11.077 --> 00:10:13.713 align:start size:97% position:3%
things, do you think it's
starting to backfire on them?

00:10:13.713 --> 00:10:17.116 align:start size:94% position:6%
