00:10:17.116 --> 00:10:18.851
that sort of, as you
alluded to earlier,

00:10:18.851 --> 00:10:21.988 align:start size:97% position:3%
they don't sort of love
talking about these topics.

00:10:21.988 --> 00:10:23.422
