or something like that,

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:33.633 align:start size:97% position:3% line:0%
but I do sense that
there's a real backlash now

00:10:33.633 --> 00:10:36.135 line:0%
where the movement
has gone so far,

00:10:36.135 --> 00:10:37.370 line:0%
that people are just like,

00:10:37.370 --> 00:10:39.038 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
you know what, forget
