00:10:39.038 --> 00:10:40.773
Like the whole thing is evil.

00:10:40.773 --> 00:10:42.041 align:start size:81% position:19%
And that's what
I'm worried about.

00:10:42.041 --> 00:10:44.810
Because when we group
these letters together,

00:10:46.045 --> 00:10:47.913 align:start size:84% position:16%
I can sort of
understand the people

00:10:47.913 --> 00:10:49.382
that are frustrated like that.

00:10:50.816 --> 00:10:52.985
- I could see that what
we're really concerns me

00:10:52.985 --> 00:10:54.487
is where we are gonna be going,

00:10:54.487 --> 00:10:56.756
what the next step
is gonna be in terms

00:10:56.756 --> 00:10:58.257
of what the outcome is gonna be.

00:10:58.257 --> 00:11:00.926
And so we're seeing also this
growing trend of nonbinary

00:11:00.926 --> 00:11:02.395
people identifying as nonbinary.

00:11:02.395 --> 00:11:04.830
And again, that can
be for some people,

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:07.933 align:start size:97% position:3%
a way of coping the fact
that they are gay or lesbian,

00:11:07.933 --> 00:11:11.370
