00:12:42.461 --> 00:12:44.430
And I think a lot of
people are sort of...

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:46.665 align:start size:88% position:13%
They're like, no, that's
the last line here

00:12:46.665 --> 00:12:48.868 align:start size:81% position:19%
that we're just
not gonna give on.

00:12:48.868 --> 00:12:50.903
Do you think that's fair to say?

00:12:50.903 --> 00:12:52.404
- Right? And again, like you,

00:12:52.404 --> 00:12:54.507
I have no issue with people
how they wanna identify,

00:12:54.507 --> 00:12:55.908
just don't tell me that,

00:12:55.908 --> 00:12:57.810 align:start size:94% position:6%
that's what the
scientific research shows,

00:12:57.810 --> 00:12:59.712 align:start size:84% position:16%
