start denying science

00:12:59.712 --> 00:13:01.213
that doesn't help anyone

00:13:01.213 --> 00:13:02.982 align:start size:97% position:3%
and the truth is eventually
going to come out.

00:13:02.982 --> 00:13:04.383
So with regards to gender,

00:13:04.383 --> 00:13:06.919 align:start size:84% position:16%
gender is binary
because for 99% of us,

00:13:06.919 --> 00:13:09.388
