00:13:13.926 --> 00:13:16.896 align:start size:94% position:6%
but that's not to say
that gender is a spectrum

00:13:16.896 --> 00:13:19.498 align:start size:84% position:16%
or that it's
however you want it.

00:13:19.498 --> 00:13:21.033
You don't, choose your gender.

00:13:21.033 --> 00:13:22.802 align:start size:97% position:3%
This is what they're
teaching in education that,

00:13:22.802 --> 00:13:25.237
