think that's also fine.

00:14:57.563 --> 00:15:00.499 align:start size:88% position:13%
I think among,
especially woke parents,

00:15:00.499 --> 00:15:01.967
they don't want their children

00:15:01.967 --> 00:15:06.238 align:start size:97% position:3%
to be gender typical nowadays,
