whoever they want,

00:15:34.867 --> 00:15:36.902 align:start size:84% position:16%
or wear whatever
they want, et cetera.

00:15:36.902 --> 00:15:39.872
Now puberty comes along
then where are you at?

00:15:41.140 --> 00:15:42.908
- Well, what would
normally happen,

00:15:42.908 --> 00:15:45.277
