say anything other than,

00:16:32.024 --> 00:16:32.958 align:start size:94% position:6%
yes, if you wanna
transition, I'll help you,

00:16:32.958 --> 00:16:34.193
I'll help to facilitate this,

00:16:34.193 --> 00:16:35.361
because they're gonna
be accused of commit

00:16:35.361 --> 00:16:37.629 align:start size:84% position:16%
