last time is not effective,

00:16:46.305 --> 00:16:47.740
it should not be done.

00:16:47.740 --> 00:16:49.341 align:start size:97% position:3%
There's no such thing as
conversion therapy for gender

00:16:49.341 --> 00:16:52.077
identity because young
children who identify

00:16:52.077 --> 00:16:55.581
