again, their gender is,

00:16:55.581 --> 00:16:57.816 align:start size:97% position:3%
I don't use the word fluid,
but it's more flexible

00:16:57.816 --> 00:16:59.618
because they haven't
fully developed yet.

00:16:59.618 --> 00:17:01.387
So with development,
they're more likely

00:17:01.387 --> 00:17:03.155
to feel differently.

00:17:04.089 --> 00:17:05.224
- All right.

00:17:05.224 --> 00:17:06.425 align:start size:84% position:16%
So just to completely
clear that up,

00:17:06.425 --> 00:17:07.359 align:start size:81% position:19%
and we did go into
the first part

00:17:07.359 --> 00:17:09.294
or the second part last time.

00:17:09.294 --> 00:17:12.364
So gender or conversion
therapy for gay people,

00:17:12.364 --> 00:17:16.535 align:start size:97% position:3%
meaning to take a young gay
boy and to do whatever version

00:17:16.535 --> 00:17:18.704
of conversion therapy there is,

00:17:18.704 --> 00:17:21.540
there's just no evidence
that, that actually works.

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:25.044
What you're saying here is
if a therapist was dealing

00:17:25.044 --> 00:17:28.480 align:start position:0%
with a young person who
identified as the other gender,

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:32.551 align:start size:94% position:6%
that in essence, they
sort of have to go with it

00:17:32.551 --> 00:17:35.587 align:start size:97% position:3%
because what is it that they
would lose their license

00:17:35.587 --> 00:17:36.989
or or is there...

00:17:36.989 --> 00:17:38.991 align:start size:88% position:13%
'Cause it's not
conversion at that point

00:17:38.991 --> 00:17:39.792
at some level, right?

00:17:39.792 --> 00:17:41.260
Like what...

00:17:41.260 --> 00:17:44.029
Or you think it's just the
pressure of being a therapist

00:17:44.029 --> 00:17:46.298
that they'll be ostracized?

00:17:46.298 --> 00:17:48.467
- It's the climate, it's
that other professionals

00:17:48.467 --> 00:17:51.003 align:start size:97% position:3%
will ostracize it's because
they do run the risk

00:17:51.003 --> 00:17:53.305 align:start size:97% position:3%
of then losing their license
because organizations

00:17:53.305 --> 00:17:54.440
will come after them and say,

00:17:54.440 --> 00:17:55.674 align:start size:84% position:16%
"You are not
practicing according

00:17:55.674 --> 00:17:57.910
to what the standards
are supposed to be."

00:17:57.910 --> 00:18:00.212
They'll also have activists
coming after them trying

00:18:00.212 --> 00:18:02.314 align:start size:88% position:13%
to ruin their reputation
and their livelihood.

00:18:02.314 --> 00:18:04.650 align:start size:88% position:13%
And so what has happened
is I know colleagues

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:07.152 align:start size:97% position:3%
who have told me that anyone
who does not feel right

00:18:07.152 --> 00:18:09.888
about this, they are
leaving the field.

00:18:09.888 --> 00:18:12.858
