00:30:38.102 --> 00:30:41.306
So don't worry,
you're not alone.

00:30:42.373 --> 00:30:44.175
- Yeah, we export everything.

00:30:44.175 --> 00:30:47.378
So that the title,
"The End of Gender,"

00:30:47.378 --> 00:30:48.913 align:start size:84% position:16%
