00:31:37.095 --> 00:31:38.463
And I really wanna emphasize,

00:31:38.463 --> 00:31:39.831 align:start size:97% position:3%
I'm actually saying-
- That's why I am asking you.

00:31:39.831 --> 00:31:41.633
That's why I'm asking you.

