00:33:56.367 --> 00:33:59.370
- Right, and by the way, it's
not just the personal issues

00:33:59.370 --> 00:34:00.838
and the medical issues
and everything else,

00:34:00.838 --> 00:34:03.074 align:start size:94% position:6%
there's gonna be an insane
