00:34:30.535 --> 00:34:32.403
"We had no idea this
was gonna happen."

00:34:32.403 --> 00:34:34.539 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they're gonna pretend
that they had no idea

00:34:34.539 --> 00:34:35.940 align:start size:84% position:16%
when they are coming
after those of us

00:34:35.940 --> 00:34:38.042
who are speaking out about it.

00:34:38.042 --> 00:34:39.610 align:start size:84% position:16%
- I know it's a little
weird to be ahead

00:34:39.610 --> 00:34:40.778
of the curve, isn't it?

00:34:40.778 --> 00:34:42.213 align:start size:88% position:13%
'Cause you kind of
feel like you're behind

00:34:42.213 --> 00:34:45.616 align:start size:94% position:6%
it sometimes as the
things start to come true.

00:34:45.616 --> 00:34:47.985
- I feel the odd thing when
I was writing this book,

00:34:47.985 --> 00:34:49.087
I felt the whole time,

00:34:49.087 --> 00:34:50.588 align:start size:88% position:13%
it was a very emotional
process for me

00:34:50.588 --> 00:34:53.024 align:start size:97% position:3%
because it felt very much
like those of us who see it,

00:34:53.024 --> 00:34:54.826 align:start size:84% position:16%
it's like we're able
to see the future

00:34:54.826 --> 00:34:56.894
and we're just trying to
scream as loud as possible

00:34:56.894 --> 00:34:58.496
to get people to pay attention.

00:35:00.131 --> 00:35:01.632
- Don't I know it, I know it.

00:35:01.632 --> 00:35:05.069 align:start size:97% position:3%
You just mentioned the
detransitioning part of this,

00:35:05.069 --> 00:35:07.171
is there a lot of literature,

00:35:07.171 --> 00:35:08.873
is there a lot of
research on that

00:35:08.873 --> 00:35:11.676
as far as how many
people have done it,

00:35:11.676 --> 00:35:13.678
are they happier after?

00:35:13.678 --> 00:35:15.613
Are they suicidal after?

00:35:15.613 --> 00:35:18.583 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, what do the
numbers look like on that?

00:35:18.583 --> 00:35:21.986 align:start size:97% position:3%
- There was one study in
Sweden that looked at people

00:35:21.986 --> 00:35:24.722
who had transitioned and then...

00:35:24.722 --> 00:35:28.292
So change the marker on
their legal documentation

00:35:28.292 --> 00:35:29.527
and then changed it back.

00:35:29.527 --> 00:35:31.829
And they found that
about 2% of people

00:35:31.829 --> 00:35:34.098 align:start size:84% position:16%
who had transitioned
changed back.

00:35:34.098 --> 00:35:36.400 align:start size:97% position:3%
But the thing is not
everyone who detransitions,

00:35:36.400 --> 00:35:38.636
does it illegally and
also the data collected

00:35:38.636 --> 00:35:42.707
for that study it finished
around 2011, I think it was.

00:35:42.707 --> 00:35:46.611
So that was before this huge
influx we see of young people,

00:35:46.611 --> 00:35:50.448
especially young women
identifying as male,

00:35:50.448 --> 00:35:51.949
and I've written quite a bit.

00:35:51.949 --> 00:35:53.818
And in the book I talk about
rapid onset gender dysphoria,

00:35:53.818 --> 00:35:57.522 align:start position:0%
which is this phenomenon of
young women who are very quickly

00:35:57.522 --> 00:35:59.991 align:start size:97% position:3%
identifying as male, wanting
to transition to male,

00:35:59.991 --> 00:36:03.094
taking testosterone, again,
getting double mastectomy.

00:36:03.094 --> 00:36:05.897 align:start size:94% position:6%
When they were very gender
typical as children,

00:36:05.897 --> 00:36:07.598
it's usually very
out of the blue,

00:36:07.598 --> 00:36:11.235 align:start size:97% position:3%
usually they have other mental
health issues like autism,

00:36:11.235 --> 00:36:12.703 align:start size:88% position:13%
for a lot of them, they
have sexual trauma,

00:36:12.703 --> 00:36:14.438
that's not being talked about.

00:36:14.438 --> 00:36:17.441 align:start size:88% position:13%
And so we don't yet
have the data for that,

00:36:17.441 --> 00:36:18.709 align:start size:94% position:6%
we don't know what that's
going to look like.

00:36:18.709 --> 00:36:21.112 align:start size:84% position:16%
Although there is
one County in the UK

00:36:21.112 --> 00:36:25.416 align:start size:84% position:16%
where hundreds of
detransitioners are
coming out and saying,

00:36:25.416 --> 00:36:30.121 align:start size:97% position:3%
I'm I have autism, I'm
lesbian and why didn't people,

00:36:30.121 --> 00:36:32.590
why didn't professionals,

